<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">Two offline devices change the same value. When both writes reach a third replica, arrival order says which packet was last, but says nothing about whether either writer had seen the other edit.</p>

<!-- @before Architecture :: animation -->
### Keep the writer’s version attached

<section class="pb-figure" data-pb-flow="scene" aria-label="Independent writes become siblings">
